<title>USA: MC Shipping sees Q4 gain from ship sale.</title>
<headline>MC Shipping sees Q4 gain from ship sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MC Shipping Inc said on Tuesday that it expects to post a $200,000 gain from the sale of its ship, the Garnet, in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The Garnet, which was acquired by the company in February 1996, was sold to Vietnamese interests, MC Shipping said.</p>
<p>MC Shipping also said it has extended the authorization of its share buyback program, authorizing an additional 200,000 shares for purchase.</p>
<p>The company has repurchased 300,000 shares since the program was initiated in April 1996, MC Shipping said.</p>
</text>
